OCaml FlatBuffers
https://github.com/TheCBaH/ocaml-flatbuffers

Initial OCaml runtime, BFBS code generator, and tests by dmitrig (2022-2023),
from https://github.com/dmitrig/flatbuffers, branch dg/ocaml.

Subsequent OCaml extensions, JavaScript support, verification, integration,
packaging, tests, and maintenance by Vladimir N. Silyaev.
Copyright 2026 Vladimir N. Silyaev, for his contributions.

This project includes code derived from Google FlatBuffers, including the
Lua/Nim BFBS generators used as the basis for the OCaml generator. Existing
Google copyright and Apache-2.0 notices are retained in src/bfbs_gen_ocaml.*.
Sample/test schemas, generated fixtures, and test data also originate in
Google FlatBuffers where identified by their source or generation rules.
https://github.com/google/flatbuffers

The Google FlatBuffers dependency is maintained as the flatbuffers/ submodule.
It retains its own license and source notices. The OCaml implementation and
subsequent additions in this repository are distributed under Apache-2.0.

